# ---- Build / CMake / compiler ----
runtime/build_x86/
runtime/build/
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/CMakeFiles/
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/Makefile
*.obj
*.o
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
*.a
